        "derivation": "The configurations comment explains that only two configurations are retained and a snapshot behind committedIndex cannot be represented. Recovery subsequently trusts the stored snapshot index and configuration. The coordinator's guard and persist/close ordering are therefore candidate obligations supporting that consumer, independently of whether its inputs and storage implementation are sound.",
